\ xmss.fam — XMSS signatures (docs/NODE.md, step 7), after arith.fam,
\ poseidon2.fam and state.fam.  As tabminer's miner/src/xmss.rs: WOTS+
\ with w = 16 (64 message chains, seven 4-bit digits and a 3-bit one an
\ element, and 3 checksum chains), a Merkle tree of the key's height, all
\ hashed by one tweakable sponge whose capacity holds the public seed, a
\ domain, a 60-bit index (two 30-bit limbs) and an extra word.
\
\ xverify ( pk sig msg -- flag )  pk the key's 49 bytes (root, public
\ seed: canonical words; its height, 1 to 20), sig the signature's bytes
\ (8 + (68 + height) 32: the leaf index, the randomizer, a value a chain,
\ the path; canonical, as the caller parsed them), msg 8 Montgomery words.
\ About 580 permutations at height 4.

: xpk variable ;  : xsig variable ;  : xmsg variable ;  : xh variable ;  : xix variable ;
: xsd variable ;  : xmd variable ;  : xd variable ;  : xends variable ;  : xnode variable ;  : xtmp variable ;
: xa variable ;  : xn variable ;  : xc variable ;  : xe variable ;

\ thcap ( dom lo hi extra -- )  the state zeroed, its capacity the tweak.
: thcap
p2s @ 10 lit wzero
tom p2s @ F lit w!  tom p2s @ E lit w!  tom p2s @ D lit w!  tom p2s @ C lit w!
xsd @ p2s @ 20 lit + 4 lit wcopy ;

\ thabs ( a n c -- )  the n words at a absorbed eight at a time (one
\ permutation if none); c (8 words) = the first eight.
: thabs
xc ! xn ! xa !
xn @ 0= if p2s @ perm16 then
begin xn @ while
	xn @ 8 lit u< if xn @ else 8 lit then
	dup 0 lit do p2s @ i w@ xa @ i w@ f+ p2s @ i w! loop
	p2s @ perm16
	dup 2 lit lshift xa @ + xa !  xn @ swap - xn !
repeat
p2s @ xc @ 8 lit wcopy ;

\ xstep ( a extra -- )  one step of a chain of leaf xix, in place.
: xstep  xe !  2 lit xix @ 0 lit xe @ thcap  dup 8 lit swap thabs ;

\ xdigits  xd (67 bytes) = the digest's digits, then the checksum's.
: xdigits
0 lit
8 lit 0 lit do
	xmd @ i w@ fromm
	8 lit 0 lit do
		dup F lit and  dup xd @ j 3 lit lshift i + + c!
		F lit swap - rot + swap  4 lit rshift
	loop drop
loop
3 lit 0 lit do dup F lit and xd @ 40 lit i + + c! 4 lit rshift loop drop ;

\ xchains  xends (67 digests) = each chain run from its digit to the end.
: xchains
43 lit 0 lit do
	xsig @ 28 lit + i 5 lit lshift +  xends @ i 5 lit lshift +  dle
	xd @ i + c@  dup F lit u< if
		F lit swap do  xends @ j 5 lit lshift +  j i 10 lit lshift or  xstep  loop
	else drop then
loop ;

: xverify  ( pk sig msg -- flag )
xmsg ! xsig ! xpk !
xpk @ 30 lit + c@ xh !
4 lit 0 lit do xpk @ 20 lit + i 2 lit lshift + le@ tom xsd @ i w! loop
xsig @ le@ xix !
xsig @ 4 lit + le@ 0=  xix @ 1 lit xh @ lshift u< and if
	\ the message's digest: the randomizer, the length (8), the message
	xsig @ 8 lit + xtmp @ dle  8 lit tom xtmp @ 8 lit w!  xmsg @ xtmp @ 24 lit + 8 lit wcopy
	5 lit xix @ 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xtmp @ 11 lit xmd @ thabs
	xdigits xchains
	3 lit xix @ 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xends @ 218 lit xnode @ thabs
	\ the path
	xh @ 0 lit do
		xsig @ 888 lit + i 5 lit lshift +
		xix @ 1 lit and if
			xtmp @ dle  xnode @ xtmp @ 20 lit + 8 lit wcopy
		else
			xtmp @ 20 lit + dle  xnode @ xtmp @ 8 lit wcopy
		then
		xix @ 1 lit rshift xix !
		4 lit xix @ xh @ i 1 lit + thcap  xtmp @ 10 lit xnode @ thabs
	loop
	xpk @ xtmp @ dle  xnode @ xtmp @ 8 lit wcmp 0=
else 0 lit then ;

: xinit
10 lit alloc xsd !  20 lit alloc xmd !  44 lit alloc xd !  860 lit alloc xends !
20 lit alloc xnode !  60 lit alloc xtmp ! ;
